{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe465fbd977d51cfbea767ab35e96977f71554fd713220aa7af3f1942cd8d1f8",
      "text": "不管做什么都很帅气，\n过去的经验完全融入到了一举手一投足之中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:949416446f9144a06a1ed56d9d244ebcebbab35b74204673929e66dcdff610ff",
      "text": "我看着Jupiter的时候，心里总是扑通扑通、非常兴奋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee93ba76e6e668fcfc627ca6e98fa2ac88ea65cef0c7df9b1bbd02ecbf1a4b86",
      "text": "对吧！片刻都无法移开视线的歌声与舞蹈，\n在恰到好处的时机送上的粉丝福利……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f668cb2230c4c13595383b02d7fb0fb6adbf50a005a7bb7f0b80ed2115d836eb",
      "text": "但这并没有结束。\n每一次看都在不断进化的表演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a24e4d3c72331f195d9e7a2e736e9945ce6b72125eb5252cd652dd5c1438797",
      "text": "这样优秀的Jupiter三个人能在同一家事务所，\n而且还担任男极的先锋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd72bffaf5c49fc02eeb879c8a651edf15c5456379f1c6383bb467699649b4c9",
      "text": "真的很让人安心呢！啊……。\n不好意思，我稍微有点太激动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc739fd5073b03c04de666dd2442d98f1c55764e0cff8cb35e5cc48fe382b20f",
      "text": "哎……我明白实先生想说什么。\nJupiter的表现力确实很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f281b37e079bc58aa5257a84351da6c7f132ed220de451b669d4791e5d131c6",
      "text": "就算在我们说话的期间，他们肯定也在继续进化着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea4dbaf219d156aeef5df46a0d6c007cd768873b2456ecacceed1b93bd50648d",
      "text": "但是，Beit也不会认输的！\n那么，重新开始练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664bd28f64ce3acbde693e39b8efdd6bf5fc3bbf011e61a6cf23067464410680",
      "text": "我带了能在接下来的练习中用到的\n超棒资料哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22eab9f13fd29e4ee67942df4bec3eafe34a1f0bf7b552f0c169a0baed083b31",
      "text": "那个难道是，前阵子信玄先生\n在事务所分发的特训菜单吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7cb51493a776ce67d9933c7528a9f66ca3c53ffa569e42345be7e1708c09e65",
      "text": "答对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81af3900a425297fd43dd1c74d176b41c464837567b7dd1ab14ec7fc142e7159",
      "text": "内容都是根据每个人的优势与不足定制的，\n趁这个机会，我们也多多进化吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
